{
  "note": "Cross-language fixture for the AIKEY_SCAN_TOKEN_KEY_FILE format. Go pkg/scantoken.ParseKeySet and Python workers/scan_token.parse_keyset must agree on every case, including the two legacy shapes that are on deployed machines today.",
